  "summary": "Adds a Clear Series Overrides action to the Queue file override drawer. The new backend preview/apply commands clear exact per-file override entries for the detected current-queue TV series while leaving inherited folder rules untouched.",
  "reason": "Operators could batch-apply a file override to a series, but had to clear exact series-level file overrides one file at a time. The reverse batch operation needs the same backend-owned preview, fingerprint, and confirmation protections as apply-to-series.",
  "affected_areas": [
