    "queue",
    "tests",
    "webview"
  ],
  "behavior_before": "The file override drawer exposed Apply to Series and Clear Override for a single file, but did not provide a backend-scoped way to clear all exact current-series file overrides.",
  "behavior_after": "The drawer exposes Clear Series Overrides. The WebView requests a backend-authored preview, shows which current-series rows will clear or stay unchanged, and sends a confirmed fingerprinted apply request that clears exact file override entries only.",
